en-US>VisibilityTimeout</span><span
 style=3D'font-family:Calibri;color:#728188' lang=3Den-IN>&nbsp;is incorrect
 because the visibility timeout is primarily used to prevent other consumers
 from processing the message again and not for detecting duplicate
 messages.<br>
  </span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;font-family:Calibri;color:#FF6600'
 lang=3Den-IN>Using an Amazon SQS Standard queue instead of a FIFO queue to=
