 any duplicate messages</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;font-family:C=
alibri;
 color:#FF6600' lang=3Den-US>&nbsp;</span><span style=3D'font-family:Calibr=
i;
 color:#728188' lang=3Den-IN>is incorrect because using&nbsp;standard queue=
s will
 actually introduce duplicate messages. Take note that FIFO queues help you
 avoid sending duplicates and not the Standard-type queue.<br>
