:11.25pt'><span
 style=3D'color:#728188' lang=3Den-IN>If you create a Lambda function to pr=
ocess
 events from event sources that aren’t poll-based (for example, Lambda can
 process every event from other sources, like Amazon S3 or API Gateway), ea=
ch
