 confident that you specified the correct properties, you can change the
 behavior to allow or block requests.<br>
  Hence, the correct answer in this scenario is&nbsp;</span><span
 style=3D'font-weight:bold;color:green' lang=3Den-US>AWS WAF.<br>
  </span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;color:#FF6600' lang=3Den-IN>Amazon
 Guard​Duty</span><span style=3D'color:#728188' lang=3Den-IN>&nbsp;is inc=
